sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Flutter as Flutter PracticeView
    participant VM as PracticeViewModel
    participant Endpoint as PracticeEndpoint
    participant Service as PracticeService
    participant Grader as Grader
    participant Calc as OutcomeCalculator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Student->>Flutter: Select Option B (or type answer) & Tap Submit
    Flutter->>VM: submitCommand.execute(optionId: 2)
    VM->>Endpoint: submitAnswer(questionId, optionId: 2)
    Endpoint->>Service: submitAnswer(learnerId, questionId, optionId: 2)
    Service->>DB: Check ReviewState (must have lastServedAt != null)
    Service->>Service: responseMs = now - lastServedAt
    alt Question is Multiple Choice
        Service->>DB: Fetch QuestionOption(id=2)
        Service->>Grader: gradeOption(option) -> valid or wrong
    else Question is Text Input
        Service->>DB: Fetch AcceptedAnswers
        Service->>Grader: gradeText(text, acceptedAnswers) -> valid or wrong
    end
    Service->>Calc: calculate(status, helpUsed, responseMs, expectedSeconds)
    Calc-->>Service: Verdict, Reason, ReflexTier (Green/Yellow/Red), Interval (+1d, +2d, +30d)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    note right of Service: Atomic Database Transaction
    Service->>DB: INSERT into attempt (..., reflex_tier, response_ms)
    Service->>DB: UPDATE review_state (due_at, interval, lapses, lastServedAt = null)
    Service->>DB: Atomic UPDATE question counters (+1 attempt, clean, underTime...)
    end

    Service->>DB: Fetch option explanations and topicNote
    Service-->>Endpoint: SubmitResult (ReflexTier, optionExplanations, topicNote)
    Endpoint-->>VM: SubmitResult
    VM->>Flutter: Emit ResultShown with ReflexTier
    Flutter-->>Student: Display Chromatic Feedback (Green/Yellow/Red background)
    Flutter-->>Student: Render "Why choice was right/wrong" explanation & Topic Note Gate
